(7357626, 1149752, 16912, '<td valign="top">I''m not docking points but would have added an extra point if the road sign wasn''t there, it takes away some of the mystery for me.</td>', 'I''m not docking points but would have added an extra point if the road sign wasn''t there, it takes away some of the mystery for me.', '2015-06-05 17:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357647, 1151329, 47974, '<td valign="top">Please upload a bigger sized photograph next time</td>', 'Please upload a bigger sized photograph next time', '2015-06-05 20:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357648, 1150770, 47974, '<td valign="top">To bad you just missed focus on the eye.</td>', 'To bad you just missed focus on the eye.', '2015-06-05 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357651, 1150098, 47974, '<td valign="top">Nice capture that could really benefit from some dodging around the eye to brighten it up and help draw attention to it a little more.</td>', 'Nice capture that could really benefit from some dodging around the eye to brighten it up and help draw attention to it a little more.', '2015-06-05 20:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357655, 1150690, 47974, '<td valign="top">Just a little unsharp, not sure if its missed focus, slow shutter or heavy crop........to bad as it would have made a great photo otherwise</td>', 'Just a little unsharp, not sure if its missed focus, slow shutter or heavy crop........to bad as it would have made a great photo otherwise', '2015-06-05 20:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357656, 1151176, 47974, '<td valign="top">Strange bokeh in the leaves</td>', 'Strange bokeh in the leaves', '2015-06-05 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357658, 1151531, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really odd crop, would have liked to see more of the area above the bird.  Leaving a little a space gives the bird somewhere to go in the frame, just to crunched in like this.  Most of all, the focus is just off and the entire photo is a little blurry.  To bad because if focus had been spot on and a bit different crop this could have been a wonderful photo.</td>', 'Really odd crop, would have liked to see more of the area above the bird.  Leaving a little a space gives the bird somewhere to go in the frame, just to crunched in like this.  Most of all, the focus is just off and the entire photo is a little blurry.  To bad because if focus had been spot on and a bit different crop this could have been a wonderful photo.', '2015-06-05 20:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357661, 1151550, 47974, '<td valign="top">Better zoom or tighter crop would have made this a much better photograph.  Well, that and if the bird was not looking away from the camera.</td>', 'Better zoom or tighter crop would have made this a much better photograph.  Well, that and if the bird was not looking away from the camera.', '2015-06-05 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357662, 1151173, 47974, '<td valign="top">Just a bit to bright, toning down the highlights some would have really made this image a lot better.</td>', 'Just a bit to bright, toning down the highlights some would have really made this image a lot better.', '2015-06-05 21:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357663, 1149624, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture</td>', 'Great capture', '2015-06-05 21:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357665, 1151370, 47974, '<td valign="top">It looks as tho you made the nest level but the trees slanting right.  Would have preferred the trees level and the next slanted personally.  Other then making me want to tilt my head it''s a great shot.</td>', 'It looks as tho you made the nest level but the trees slanting right.  Would have preferred the trees level and the next slanted personally.  Other then making me want to tilt my head it''s a great shot.', '2015-06-05 21:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357666, 1151359, 47974, '<td valign="top">Just a little to dark for my taste.  Beautiful DOF and bokeh, will be interesting to see what lens was used for this.</td>', 'Just a little to dark for my taste.  Beautiful DOF and bokeh, will be interesting to see what lens was used for this.', '2015-06-05 21:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357667, 1151358, 47974, '<td valign="top">Way to saturated for my taste but love the composition and the placement of the sun.</td>', 'Way to saturated for my taste but love the composition and the placement of the sun.', '2015-06-05 21:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357669, 1151244, 47974, '<td valign="top">Snails are one of my favorite macro subjects and as I have found are not easy to capture.  You did a great job of getting the right areas into focus but I can''t help but sit here wondering where the other eye stalk is at.  Maybe if you had waited to get both of them in view and preferably in focus if possible.  Not a fan of the dirt background but would have greatly improved the shot if you had a gotten a bit lower to the ground.</td>', 'Snails are one of my favorite macro subjects and as I have found are not easy to capture.  You did a great job of getting the right areas into focus but I can''t help but sit here wondering where the other eye stalk is at.  Maybe if you had waited to get both of them in view and preferably in focus if possible.  Not a fan of the dirt background but would have greatly improved the shot if you had a gotten a bit lower to the ground.', '2015-06-05 21:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357670, 1150584, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wish it was just a little brighter.  Beautiful composition and love the reflection.</td>', 'Wish it was just a little brighter.  Beautiful composition and love the reflection.', '2015-06-05 21:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357671, 1151314, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is some really shallow DOF.  Lighting is a little dull/flat</td>', 'Wow, that is some really shallow DOF.  Lighting is a little dull/flat', '2015-06-05 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357673, 1150979, 47974, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, his natural camo is so effective.  Would have preferred a tighter or square crop on this one tho, a little to much dead space.</td>', 'Love the shot, his natural camo is so effective.  Would have preferred a tighter or square crop on this one tho, a little to much dead space.', '2015-06-05 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357674, 1151121, 47974, '<td valign="top">Super creative use of the fisheye, really love it.</td>', 'Super creative use of the fisheye, really love it.', '2015-06-05 21:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357675, 1151375, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really great shot and love the conversion/colors......hate the texture added it.  Would have been a 7+ if not for the texture.</td>', 'Really great shot and love the conversion/colors......hate the texture added it.  Would have been a 7+ if not for the texture.', '2015-06-05 21:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357676, 1151427, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really fun shot that made me smile as it popped on the screen.</td>', 'Really fun shot that made me smile as it popped on the screen.', '2015-06-05 21:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357677, 1151093, 47974, '<td valign="top">What a cute little guy, great find and capture.  Looks like the eye is just out of focus and some dodging around the eye would have helped some also.</td>', 'What a cute little guy, great find and capture.  Looks like the eye is just out of focus and some dodging around the eye would have helped some also.', '2015-06-05 21:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357679, 1151082, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and colors.  Lighting is just a little flat to me and would have liked a bit more DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and colors.  Lighting is just a little flat to me and would have liked a bit more DOF.', '2015-06-05 21:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357681, 1151476, 47974, '<td valign="top">Would have been a great photo if focus was on the eyes, looks like plane of focus is middle to front of snout.</td>', 'Would have been a great photo if focus was on the eyes, looks like plane of focus is middle to front of snout.', '2015-06-05 21:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357682, 1151106, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really great shot, not a fan of the processing.  Seems a little soft or maybe a heavy crop or could be the processing......can not really put my finger on it.</td>', 'Really great shot, not a fan of the processing.  Seems a little soft or maybe a heavy crop or could be the processing......can not really put my finger on it.', '2015-06-05 21:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7357717, 1151358, 135744, '<td valign="top">Incredible view. Possibly a bit too much of the ground (which isn''t quite so stunning) but overall very nice. I love the splash of colour of the sun too.</td>', 'Incredible view. Possibly a bit too much of the ground (which isn''t quite so stunning) but overall very nice. I love the splash of colour of the sun too.', '2015-06-06 04:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
