(7357847, 1149752, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this a bunch.  I really, really, REALLY wish those roads signs had been cloned out. 99% certain it would have been legal to do in this case (not prominent).  Anyway ... good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this a bunch.  I really, really, REALLY wish those roads signs had been cloned out. 99% certain it would have been legal to do in this case (not prominent).  Anyway ... good luck to you in the challenge.', '2015-06-06 16:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
