(7358797, 1150531, 128323, '<td valign="top">What a magical place.  Congrats on a well-deserved blue!</td>', 'What a magical place.  Congrats on a well-deserved blue!', '2015-06-08 11:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358799, 1151305, 128323, '<td valign="top">The detail is amazing in this, and that sky is wild.  Congrats Mark!</td>', 'The detail is amazing in this, and that sky is wild.  Congrats Mark!', '2015-06-08 11:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358801, 1151185, 128323, '<td valign="top">It looks like those wings are about to catch fire!  Love the HUD reflection in the cockpit too.  Congrats on the TT!</td>', 'It looks like those wings are about to catch fire!  Love the HUD reflection in the cockpit too.  Congrats on the TT!', '2015-06-08 11:54:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358806, 1151427, 16148, '<td valign="top">In his element.  No place he''d rather be.<br/> <br/>A beautiful portrait but the lady wearing the red jacket detracts a little.  I see some forced perspective going on.  Did you try black and white?  Might be able to make her blend more with his surroundings.   I do like this in color so maybe desaturation would work too.  <br/> <br/>All in all a very nice image.  Just some random thoughts that came to mind.</td>', 'In his element.  No place he''d rather be. A beautiful portrait but the lady wearing the red jacket detracts a little.  I see some forced perspective going on.  Did you try black and white?  Might be able to make her blend more with his surroundings.   I do like this in color so maybe desaturation would work too.   All in all a very nice image.  Just some random thoughts that came to mind.', '2015-06-08 12:05:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358812, 1150530, 16148, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be a pinhole.  The fact that this scored so poorly and yet received wonderful praise is something worth contemplating.  Makes me feel good just knowing I appreciated it.  Congratulations on your well deserved bling.</td>', 'I thought this might be a pinhole.  The fact that this scored so poorly and yet received wonderful praise is something worth contemplating.  Makes me feel good just knowing I appreciated it.  Congratulations on your well deserved bling.', '2015-06-08 12:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358835, 1151004, 68504, '<td valign="top">heartrending.</td>', 'heartrending.', '2015-06-08 12:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358836, 1150530, 20799, '<td valign="top">Guess I forgot to bump this to 10... sorry about that. Lovely shapes &amp; dog.</td>', 'Guess I forgot to bump this to 10... sorry about that. Lovely shapes & dog.', '2015-06-08 12:49:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358842, 1151185, 141409, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind comments. Got pretty excited as this went over 6.8 at one point but really pleased with a TT finish. <br/> <br/>Just for info this was taken with a Nikon 70-200mm f2.8 and Nikon 1.7x TC. Stopped down slightly it gives great sharpness and the AF performance is still top notch as well.  Not sure how fast this was travelling but it certainly wasn''t hanging around.  Shame there''s no afterburner!</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind comments. Got pretty excited as this went over 6.8 at one point but really pleased with a TT finish.  Just for info this was taken with a Nikon 70-200mm f2.8 and Nikon 1.7x TC. Stopped down slightly it gives great sharpness and the AF performance is still top notch as well.  Not sure how fast this was travelling but it certainly wasn''t hanging around.  Shame there''s no afterburner!', '2015-06-08 12:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358846, 1151548, 20799, '<td valign="top">I was one of the 8s. I loved the tree shapes that turn into lung x-ray :-).</td>', 'I was one of the 8s. I loved the tree shapes that turn into lung x-ray :-).', '2015-06-08 13:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358848, 1150530, 30861, '<td valign="top">I was another of your 10''s. I''m delighted to see Ubique thumbed you. For my part, I''m blown away by the Dachshund, and the emergent T-bird (my Aunt had one just like that) is sublime :-)</td>', 'I was another of your 10''s. I''m delighted to see Ubique thumbed you. For my part, I''m blown away by the Dachshund, and the emergent T-bird (my Aunt had one just like that) is sublime :-)', '2015-06-08 13:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358859, 1151493, 112739, '<td valign="top">I agree with Jane, totally under appreciated.</td>', 'I agree with Jane, totally under appreciated.', '2015-06-08 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358865, 1151491, 100831, '<td valign="top">oh the eye... love this.</td>', 'oh the eye... love this.', '2015-06-08 13:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7358867, 1150530, 50864, '<td valign="top">I agree Henry the pinholes don''t usually score well ( unless made by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">whiteroom</a>or my clever brother <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pointandshoot</a>). But the score doesnt really matter. I am grateful there are people here that appreciate them. <br/>Thanks again for all of the wonderful comments.<br/></td>', 'I agree Henry the pinholes don''t usually score well ( unless made by  whiteroomor my clever brother  pointandshoot). But the score doesnt really matter. I am grateful there are people here that appreciate them. Thanks again for all of the wonderful comments.', '2015-06-08 13:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
