(7359105, 1151371, 83313, '<td valign="top">I only got around to voting about 50% of the challenge and this was one that I didn''t get to. When reviewing the results, however, it caught my eye. I find it very similar in approach to a shot I entered a couple of years back that also pulled a finish in the same range of meh.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1080960" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1790/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1080960.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1790/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1080960.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1790/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1080960.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I think the graininess in the clouds might have cost a little pointage.</td>', 'I only got around to voting about 50% of the challenge and this was one that I didn''t get to. When reviewing the results, however, it caught my eye. I find it very similar in approach to a shot I entered a couple of years back that also pulled a finish in the same range of meh.  I think the graininess in the clouds might have cost a little pointage.', '2015-06-08 20:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
