(7359109, 1151009, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Luciemac:</b></div><hr/><i> An adorable portrait, but the mysterious green and white line through the center......intentional? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gmink:</b></div><hr/><i> Why the green line? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> I love the photo. I''m extremely confused about the line. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by illini75:</b></div><hr/><i> So cute but why the line through the center </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LN13:</b></div><hr/><i> What is that line across the middle? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Looks to me like a corrupted file that you failed to notice after uploading, or it happened afterwards. I have seen very similar artifacts from time to time in corrupted image files.</td>', 'Originally posted by Luciemac: An adorable portrait, but the mysterious green and white line through the center......intentional?   Originally posted by gmink: Why the green line?   Originally posted by giantmike: I love the photo. I''m extremely confused about the line.   Originally posted by illini75: So cute but why the line through the center   Originally posted by LN13: What is that line across the middle?   Looks to me like a corrupted file that you failed to notice after uploading, or it happened afterwards. I have seen very similar artifacts from time to time in corrupted image files.', '2015-06-08 20:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
