(7359419, 1150932, 96574, '<td valign="top">Thanks for comments folks.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> A magnificent image of a very moving ritual.<br/> <br/>How do they round up all these guys? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There''s a rope with floaters strung across the channel farther down the beach and the majority of lanterns gather up there.  This year there were over 6,000 lanterns in the water.</td>', 'Thanks for comments folks. Originally posted by tanguera: A magnificent image of a very moving ritual. How do they round up all these guys?   There''s a rope with floaters strung across the channel farther down the beach and the majority of lanterns gather up there.  This year there were over 6,000 lanterns in the water.', '2015-06-09 13:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
