(7360908, 1151283, 9581, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors here how they balance out from top to bottom. I also like how the sky is so much in focused. Wondering what it would look like with out photoshop tools. Because sometimes I try things like focusing or noise reduction and it only seems to make the image look fake. So if you tried not doing anything to so that the bottom where the grass and rocks are  soft more natural even with out focus it would still be a really pleasing photo. <br/> <br/>Hope my comment was helpful I chose this from the critique club...</td>', 'I really like the colors here how they balance out from top to bottom. I also like how the sky is so much in focused. Wondering what it would look like with out photoshop tools. Because sometimes I try things like focusing or noise reduction and it only seems to make the image look fake. So if you tried not doing anything to so that the bottom where the grass and rocks are  soft more natural even with out focus it would still be a really pleasing photo.  Hope my comment was helpful I chose this from the critique club...', '2015-06-11 23:55:36.000000', NULL, 0),
